  questionButtonPrefab: {fileID: 8698579832377765160, guid: 51c197a4a7bbfad46826022ce4d2f390, type: 3}
  makeTeaButton: {fileID: 1326832732}
  feedbackText: {fileID: 1068430099}
  clickToContinueOverlay: {fileID: 43455009}
  endOfDayPanel: {fileID: 104421893}
  endOfDayText: {fileID: 104421892}
  endOfDayClickToContinueOverlay: {fileID: 104421890}
  endOfDayLines:
  - Every cup I served today was different. Different ingredients, different stories,
    different people.
  - But behind every order was someone carrying something.
  - "Fear. Loneliness. Doubt. Grief\u2026"
  - The feeling of being stuck.
  - It's easy to think these things only happen to other people... until one day
    they happen to you.
  - I've learned that no one is immune to them...  including me.
  - Maybe we can't solve someone's problems with a cup of tea, but no one has to
    face them alone.
  - Well, tomorrow is a new day and new challenges await for me. Still, I hope it
    will be just a bit easier.
